#### markdown ####
content:
### Collecting
* Collecting sets or minifigures
* Collecting specific themes
* Collecting retro sets and sealed sets
* Buying and selling sets between hobbyists

#### markdown ####
content:
### Building
* Building sets according to official instructions
* Building sets according to fan-created instructions
* Modifying sets
* Designing and building your own creations
* Creating your own instructions
* Hunting for suitable parts

#### markdown ####
content:
### Photography
* Showcasing sets and creations through images
* Photographing minifigures on adventures around the world
* Photographing scenes built from LEGO bricks
* Stop-motion animations built frame-by-frame

#### markdown ####
content:
## Activities

#### markdown ####
content:
### Building Competitions
* Building competitions and challenges held within specific rules
* Competitions may include prizes

#### markdown ####
content:
### Exhibitions
* Showcasing LEGO sets
* Presenting own creations
* Sales and brick trading events

#### markdown ####
content:
### Collaborative builds
* Creations made by the joint effort of several hobbyists
* Multiple creations within the same theme
* Collaborative builds where each individual's project is connected to others

#### markdown ####
content:
### Meetups
* Gatherings of local hobbyists
* Online meetups
* Online chats and forums